  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto recently hosted a meeting at his Hambalang residence involving ten former chiefs of the Indonesian National Police. The delegation included the Minister of Home Affairs, Tito Karnavian, who is also a former police chief. According to media reports, the discussion centered on internal police affairs, with the former officials explicitly pledging their commitment to supporting the current administration's agenda and overall national law enforcement operations. Political analysts have described the gathering as a signal of state authority and political coordination, particularly in the context of ongoing national discussions regarding surveillance and governance. The meeting brought together leaders from various generations of the police force to engage with the President on matters affecting institutional stability and the rule of law within the country.",
